每一篇：知微见著，一个现象后面是一整幅图景。妥帖流畅，事实咬合不磕绊。向善促好，写出来的东西往好里推。博文周纳，面上有格局，点上有颗粒。\n\n从”怎么回事捏“到“哦哦对对对”。", "downloads": 35, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_e6fb806d/media-fighter-may2026", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/62f73a9b-1aca-4f8e-921d-6102e258c768.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "mediafighter/媒体战士", "ownerName": "user_e6fb806d", "score": 1728.395061728395, "slug": "media-fighter-may2026", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780295004548, "version": "1.0.1"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779589355523, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 35, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_70c2f807/meeting-time-coordinator", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "会议时间智能协调", "ownerName": "user_70c2f807", "score": 569.7541917629823, "slug": "meeting-time-coordinator", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780295002873, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779560551963, "description": "Build structured medical literature search strategies from natural language research questions using PICO/PEO frameworks with progressive clarification dialogue. Supports funnel-style questioning to transform vague user queries into precise research objectives before generating search strategies. Supports PubMed, Embase, Cochrane Library, Web of Science, and arXiv. Use when: the user asks to construct search strings, build search strategies for systematic reviews, convert research questions to database queries, mentions PICO/PEO, or needs PubMed/Embase/Cochrane search syntax. Handles vague, incomplete, or ambiguous queries through structured clarification. NOT for: performing actual database searches, downloading papers, or full systematic review execution.", "description_zh": "Build structured medical literature search strategies from natural language research ques